00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:36.860
No!

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.950
Where are we?

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:26.230
Episode 74

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:26.230
The Lost Planet

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.580
C'mon!

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.170
It's no good.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:35.210
Are you still after her?

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:39.430
They learned the truth. They'll decide for themselves.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.720
Where we are?

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.320
Tails, you should rest.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:01.610
I want to check for myself! There's no way that Cosmo is a Metarex spy!

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:14.290
Wait, Sonic! You're still hurt!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.920
Don't worry! I'll be right back.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.380
Wait!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.050
I'm going too!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.100
I won't let you get away!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.600
Hi.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:29.730
You!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:36.480
Let's tidy up the room so that Cosmo can rest, Cheese.

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.910
Cosmo...

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:50.910
There are no transmitters or listening devices.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:52.080
Just as I thought!

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.170
Wait!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.430
What is it?

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:08.260
Cosmo's brain is emitting a tiny transmission.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.600
It's so weak that the radar wouldn't detect it.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:17.110
Everything Cosmo saw and heard were sent to Dark Oak.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:23.820
He was eavesdropping on our activities through Cosmo's eyes and ears?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.030
He was letting us go this entire time.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:32.210
He stopped us when necessary and gave us info when it was convenient.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:37.500
That way, he could get rid of us whenever he wanted.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:45.380
In other words, the friendlier we became with Cosmo, the more it helped Dark Oak.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:49.560
Can't we just remove the bad section?

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:51.310
By doing surgery?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:57.360
The section that controls Cosmo's sight and hearing are completely linked with Dark Oak.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:02.820
If we remove it, Cosmo will lose her sight and hearing.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.410
What can we do?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.830
Even Cosmo didn't know about this!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:15.250
I know!

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:20.460
How can we free her from Dark Oak?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.260
I don't know!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:25.300
Cut it out, both of you!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:31.100
Chris, you have to help Cosmo too!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.600
It's impossible.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:41.070
There are only two choices. Either Cosmo loses her sight and hearing or we defeat Dark Oak.

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:45.570
How can we defeat him when he knows all our strategies?

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.910
Knuckles, be quiet!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.950
This is also an important mission.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.960
We can't feel secure until we know what the planet is like.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.120
I guess so.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:01.340
I don't want to stay on board the ship right now, okay?

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.210
I didn't say anything.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.880
I wish you'd look where you're going.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:10.220
Why did you bring Shadow?

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.430
He put us in danger!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:17.850
You would've eventually found out that the Metarex were using her.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.560
So you think it's okay to kill her before they find out?

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.110
That's for you to decide.

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.650
You must be kidding!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.740
Up ahead!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.130
Who is it?

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.750
What's with you? You don't need to yell at me.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.550
Why are you calling me?

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:52.300
None of this would've happened if you didn't bring him along!

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:51.010
Yeah yeah.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.600
Here, Amy.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.560
Knuckles, I found out where we are.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.060
What?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:03.360
This is Cosmo and the Metarex's home planet!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.450
Welcome to Planet Green Gate.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:19.210
And farewell. There's nothing left on this planet.

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.210
There's no one left.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:27.000
It's a lost planet, a graveyard engraved with our sins.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.680
Hey!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.800
You really did a number on the ship.

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:36.310
It'll take a lot of work to fix.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.140
It won't hurt to help us out.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.350
Besides, you're not doing anything right now.

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:48.150
So you decided to stop obeying him.

00:07:50.190 --> 00:07:53.360
I might kill you next time.

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.530
I'll fight you anytime!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:59.750
If that's what you want.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:17.890
Our hate and sadness created this destruction.

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:26.560
It started long ago in a war that engulfed the entire galaxy.

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:43.330
At this rate, we'll all die! I'll transform into Mover Mode and stall them!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.290
But...

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:43.140
If you transform into Mover Mode, you use up all your energy and die.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:48.150
But if we don't fight, those beasts will wipe us out!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:55.360
Sensing that our tribe is in danger, there are many cases of children suddenly evolving into Mover Mode.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:10:02.290
At this rate, which will happen first? Die from the war or kill ourselves through mutation?

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.830
Let's leave this planet.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:11.250
Let's abandon this war-torn planet and find a new peaceful world.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.260
What's that?

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:18.380
If you wear this, you will never enter Mover Mode.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:27.520
Instead of using our power, you want us to run away, Earthia?

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.020
Luchs!

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:33.940
You want to let the beasts run over the universe?

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.070
We have no other choice.

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:43.700
The beast will destroy the universe! All they ever do is fight!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.960
Do you want all of us to die in a neverending war?

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.040
What?

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:03.550
Luchs and the other men are against our plan to leave.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:06.640
I understand how they feel.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:10.440
But we have no other choice.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.020
Earthia! Outside!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:17.440
The plants are beginning to wither!

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.280
What?

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:27.160
Luchs!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.410
Hi, Earthia.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.920
Luchs, there's trouble outside!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.710
Something is wrong with the land, water and plants!

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.510
This is...

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:44.720
Isn't it beautiful?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:48.560
It's the Planet Egg, the crystallization of this planet's life energy.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:54.150
I learned that if it keeps supplying us with energy, we won't die even if we transform into Mover Mode.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.480
How could you do this?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:00.490
Controlling the energy is still unstable.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:05.410
But if I solve that problem, we can use Mover power forever!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:09.080
Earthia, we can survive!

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:16.340
I kept believing that we could come home to this planet someday...

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.460
Earthia?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:29.520
Do you know what you did? You killed your own planet!

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.390
It's just a planet.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.810
Don't get sentimental!

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:35.690
Ouch!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:39.940
We have to gather the Planet Eggs from the surrounding planets immediately!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:43.110
We'll build a Mover army and counterattack!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.490
Luchs...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.200
Let go of me!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:53.160
We'll wipe out the beasts and bring peace and order to the universe!

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.330
Luchs...

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:15.390
Why, Earthia?

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:20.020
230 survivors are still fighting back.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.320
You may use nuclear weapons.

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:29.530
I'm going to fuse with this ship's navigation system.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:34.660
I'll use my power to guide you to a peaceful universe!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.970
Why can't you understand?

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:52.430
Actually, it's fine if you don't understand. Keep saying your futile prayers and perish.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:04.110
We are the ones who can guide all life in the universe in the proper direction.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:08.200
For tranquility and order in the universe!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:15.500
They perished along with the planet.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:23.590
But if any managed to survive, our clan is prepared to risk our lives to stop them.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:29.090
We cannot let them take control of the universe!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:31.350
We have to stop them.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:33.930
Sonic!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.270
Let's end this once and for all.

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.360
I don't understand.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:55.700
She was afraid of them because they were willing to steal the lives of planets to pursue order.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.620
Still, I can't believe members of the same tribe killed each other.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.750
Actually...

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.750
Please stop what you're doing!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.840
Forget about her! Go!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:14.680
Since they're from the same tribe, it's even harder to forgive.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.100
Is something wrong with you? You're actually making sense.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:20.650
It might even snow now.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:23.610
What's wrong if I make sense?

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.070
You always pick on me!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:31.030
Hate and sadness...

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.280
Cosmo, are you hungry?

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.160
Want me to make you soup or pudding?

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.170
Mama taught me how to make them. They're really delicious.

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.750
Leave me alone!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.590
Cosmo...

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.840
You know what I am.

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:55.220
I was a Metarex spy!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.010
No, you weren't!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:02.150
You're our dear friend, Cosmo!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.400
Stop it!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:10.280
Your "friend" put you all in danger!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:15.070
It would've been better if Shadow killed me!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:18.950
Please don't say that.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:23.080
Tails risked his life to protect you!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.130
He risked his life...

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.500
Leave me alone.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.880
Cosmo...

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.380
Leave!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:54.860
Dark Oak even heard this conversation...

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:59.200
Hey, should you be up and about?

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.120
I have no time to sleep.

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.210
Are you okay, Sonic?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:06.000
I'm more durable than you, Chris.

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:10.130
I'm analyzing the data that Rouge gave me.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.800
Information on the Metarex?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:17.550
I don't know who compiled this, but it seems like a very important file.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.220
There's data on Cosmo, but there's much more.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:26.230
Remember the data that Tails retrieved from the Metarex base?

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.520
By crosschecking with that data, I was able to decipher the file.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:37.030
The Metarex are placing fake Chaos Emeralds throughout the galaxy to create forests where no creatures can live.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:42.040
The Forestation Project creates a tranquil and peaceful universe.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:49.170
I wish we realized this when Cosmo was able to read Metarex writing.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.720
Then maybe we could've done something for her.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:03.100
Dwelling on the past won't get us anywhere.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:08.060
Yeah, but this is too cruel.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:17.950
I don't know what to say to Tails and Cosmo.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.950
That's pathetic of me. I'm an adult, after all.

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.950
That doesn't matter.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:27.170
Being an adult or a child...

00:18:27.170 --> 00:18:28.920
You're you, Chris.

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.880
Besides, they already know the answer.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.470
Cosmo and Tails.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:43.760
So do Amy, Cream, Cheese and Knuckles.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.060
Everyone knows.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:48.770
You're right.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:54.650
Where are you going?

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:01.370
Stay back! I'm leaving this ship.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.080
Then what are you going to do?

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:08.830
I'm going after Dark Oak, even if he already knows everything.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.630
You're going to fight him alone?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:14.340
I'm frustrated!

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:15.670
I want to do something!

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.420
I must do something!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.970
Because I survived!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:24.430
I took his hand and survived!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:26.390
I'll go with you.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:30.850
He knows everything I do.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:31.770
Yup.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.980
You're in trouble because of me.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.980
It's not your fault.

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:44.120
My hate and sadness will lead everyone to their deaths!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:51.420
There's something I believe in that no amount of hate and sadness can destroy.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:56.960
Where are you two going?

00:19:57.800 --> 00:20:01.340
If you're going to fight them, we're coming too!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.260
You amateurs can't sneak out on us!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.640
Can't you say it nicer?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:08.930
What?

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:10.600
Everyone...

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:15.650
As long as we win, it doesn't matter if they eavesdrop on us!

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.820
We're no match for you.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:24.410
I told you before that we always have friends that we can trust.

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.240
Tails...

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:35.330
They're fools.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.300
You might be right.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:43.260
But that's why they can do crazy things, such as risking their lives to save the world.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.100
Will you come with us?

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.970
I don't care if you take advantage of us.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:56.770
As long as our goals are the same. you'll have more options working together than by trying alone.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.360
How about it?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:04.070
Since you're traveling with a spy, you're more of a hindrance than a help.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.990
You may be right.

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.370
Hey, Shadow...

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.620
I finally found you!

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.880
You're with Eggman!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.840
Please, Shadow...

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:21.380
Save Dr. Eggman!

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:27.220
What do you think you're doing?

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.220
Let us out right now!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:33.390
You pretended to work with the Metarex in order to steal information.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:36.940
We knew what your plan was from the very beginning.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.610
What are you talking about?

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:45.110
You can't talk like that after taking advantage of Dr. Eggman's technology!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.660
We will continue to use the technology that you provided us.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:52.500
Rest in peace, Eggman.

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.710
You're horrible!

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:07.260
Dark Oak, the Forestation Project is ready.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:12.890
Dark Oak?

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:20.690
Earthia, your daughter is following in your footsteps.

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:25.190
But there's nothing they can do.

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:35.080
I've gathered all the lights.

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:40.330
The universe will sink into tranquility and order.

